OL,3,AAsos hackers took more personal details
OL,4,Athan first revealed, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsos has told its customers that
OL,7,Fhackers are in possession of detailed
OL,8,Fprofiles of potentially millions of the
OL,9,Fonline store's users.
OL,11,FIt issued the update after BBC News
OL,12,Ftold the retailer it had been contacted
OL,13,Fby cyber criminals who said this week's
OL,14,Fbreach went beyond the "basic contact
OL,15,Fdetails" Asos previously said might
OL,16,Fhave been accessed.
OL,18,FNames, addresses, phone numbers, emails
OL,19,Fand customer numbers are now in the
OL,20,Fhands of cyber criminals.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
